# Deterministic course-select preview hold. Stops on the six rotating 3D course
# maps before choosing a course, so viewport/model-scale regressions can be
# captured without racing through the screen.
WAITTITLE 3600
PRESS START 3
WAITMODE 7 3600
WAIT 120
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 10 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 180
LOG course_preview_hold
WAIT 180
SHOT course_preview_hold
WAIT 720
QUIT
